As i said above you are entering what i call the build up phase.
During this phase youll want to get your Ascension kit (AK) nearly
complete, of which it seems you have little.
You need to complete your quest, which will fill in up to few slots of
the AK
It seems youve found a coalligned altar.  Use it, and possibly the room
its in as sort of a homebase.
HInts: Religous charities give good gifts.  King Croesus hides most his
gold in his fort, but he doesnt "put all his eggs in one basket".

